# Applies to every `docker build` in this repo (all Dockerfiles use the repo
# root as build context — see infra/docker/*.Dockerfile). Keeps build
# contexts small and, more importantly, keeps host-built artifacts and
# secrets out of images (everything here is rebuilt fresh inside the image).

# VCS / editor
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
*.log

# Dependencies (installed fresh inside the image)
**/node_modules

# Build outputs (rebuilt fresh inside the image)
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
apps/extension/dist

# Env files / secrets — never bake real secrets into an image layer.
# Docker's dockerignore patterns don't treat a leading dot specially, so
# `infra/env/*.example` below matches `infra/env/.env.*.example` fine.
.env
.env.*
!infra/env/*.example

# Docs, tests fixtures and misc not needed inside any image
docs
tests
*.md
!README.md

# Editor/OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# This tool's own scratch area, if ever present under the repo
.tools
